---
import LegalPage from "../../layouts/LegalPage.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../lib/site-config";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy — LENZ"
  description="How LENZ collects, uses, and protects information submitted through this website."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="September 11, 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information LENZ collects through this website
    (<strong>lenzphotos.com</strong>), why, and how it's handled. It covers this website only — not
    information Sarah Lenz collects separately during a photography or video project (for example,
    on a paper contract or a booking call).
  </p>

  <h2>Information collected through the contact form</h2>
  <p>When you submit the inquiry form on the Contact page, LENZ collects:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Company or business name, if provided</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Phone number, if provided</li>
    <li>Project type (Commercial, Branding, Aerial, or General Inquiry)</li>
    <li>Project location/city, if provided</li>
    <li>The project details you write in</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and plan a potential project. It is
    not sold, and it is not used for advertising or marketing to you beyond replying to what you
    submitted.
  </p>
  <p>
    The form also includes a hidden field that legitimate visitors never see or fill in — it exists
    only to catch automated spam and isn't used to collect information about you.
  </p>

  <h2>Real estate booking</h2>
  <p>
    "Book Real Estate" links on this site take you to LENZ's real estate ordering system, operated
    by a third party (HDPhotoHub), on their own domain. Information you submit there is governed by
    that provider's privacy policy, not this one.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand overall traffic — things like total
    visits, which pages are viewed, and general referral/location trends. It's cookieless: it
    doesn't use tracking cookies or build an individual profile of you across visits or other
    sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Who processes this information</h2>
  <p>Form submissions and site analytics currently pass through:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Netlify</strong> — hosts this website and processes contact-form submissions.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — provides the cookieless analytics described above.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain inquiry information only as long as reasonably necessary to respond to your request,
    provide services, maintain business records, and meet applicable legal or accounting
    obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    This site is served over HTTPS, so information submitted through the contact form is encrypted
    in transit.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can decline to submit the contact form and instead reach LENZ directly by email or phone
    (see Contact page). To request that previously submitted inquiry information be deleted, email
    the address below.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy, or requests about your information: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}>{siteConfig.contact.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
